                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "Here are the key differences between your premium and standard subscription plans:\n\nStandard Plan\n• Up to 5 team members\n• 10GB storage per workspace\n• Email support with 24h response time\n• Basic analytics dashboard\n\nPremium Plan\n• Unlimited team members\n• 100GB storage per workspace\n• Priority support with 4h response time\n• Advanced analytics with custom reports",
