                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "The main differences between your premium and standard plans are:\n\nCapacity & Scale\nStandard supports 5 users with 10GB storage, while Premium offers unlimited users and 100GB storage.\n\nSupport Level\nStandard includes email support (24h SLA). Premium upgrades to priority support with a 4h SLA and dedicated account manager.\n\nAnalytics\nStandard provides a basic dashboard. Premium unlocks custom reports, export functionality, and API access.",
