          "id": "TYzj6",
          "x": 12420,
          "y": -200,
          "width": 300,
          "height": 180,
          "content": "UX Decision: Removed the 'Use' button from Prompt Library rows in the History Sidebar. The entire row is now clickable to insert the prompt, matching the interaction pattern of chat history rows (click to open). This keeps the sidebar consistent — history rows use hover actions (rename, archive, delete) without persistent action buttons, so prompt rows should follow the same pattern."
